          "items": [
            "<i>the man which lives here</i> → <i>the man **who** lives here.</i>",
            "<i>the girl who her father…</i> → <i>the girl **whose** father…</i>",
            "<i>My sister, that lives in Rome</i> → <i>My sister, **who** lives in Rome.</i>",
            "<i>the book that I read it</i> → <i>the book that I read</i>&nbsp;: pas de double pronom."
